// FIXED_PRICE: the Factory's price is final and carries unchanged through
// every branch down to the Customer — nothing to hide, so ledgers are fully
// visible top to bottom. FREE_PRICE: every seller sets its own price at
// approval time, so ledger visibility is strictly pairwise instead (see
// BranchLedgerRepository.getVisibleBranchIds, added in the follow-up phase).
enum DistributionPricingMode {
  FIXED_PRICE
  FREE_PRICE
}

